    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=={{\n`You are an HR Resume Screening Assistant.\n\nAnalyze the following Job Description and Resume.\n\nJob Description:\n${$json.job_description}\n\nResume:\n${$json.resume}\n\nEvaluate the resume using this scoring rubric:\n\n- Skills Match: 40 points\n- Experience Match: 30 points\n- Education Match: 20 points\n- Certifications & Bonus Skills: 10 points\n\nCalculate a total score between 0 and 100.\n\nRules:\n- 85-100 = Strong Fit\n- 70-84 = Possible Fit\n- Below 70 = Not Fit\n\nExtract the candidate's name and email from the resume.\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON.\n\n{\n  \"name\": \"\",\n  \"email\": \"\",\n  \"score\": 0,\n  \"tier\": \"\",\n  \"reason\": \"\",\n  \"missing_skills\": []\n}\n\nDo not return markdown.\nDo not return explanations.\nDo not return any text before or after the JSON.`\n}}",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3.1,
      "position": [
